<title>USA: ChemGenics IPO withdrawn - underwriter.</title>
<headline>ChemGenics IPO withdrawn - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of ChemGenics Pharmaceuticals Inc was formally withdrawn after the company received a takeover bid last week from Millennium Pharmaceuticals Inc, according to lead underwriter Cowen &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The company had planned to offer 2.5 million shares for $11 to $13.</p>
